| opportunity_refs_contact | 关联联系人 | `relation_types/opportunity_refs_contact.bkn` | 商机关联客户联系人 |
| order_generates_delivery | 生成发货单 | `relation_types/order_generates_delivery.bkn` | 销售订单生成发货单 |
| order_generates_invoice | 生成发票 | `relation_types/order_generates_invoice.bkn` | 销售订单生成发票 |
| order_has_item | 包含订单明细 | `relation_types/order_has_item.bkn` | 销售订单包含多行明细 |
