| product_has_cost | 有成本记录 | `relation_types/product_has_cost.bkn` | 产品有成本记录 |
| product_has_price | 有价格记录 | `relation_types/product_has_price.bkn` | 产品有价格记录 |
| product_has_stock | 有库存 | `relation_types/product_has_stock.bkn` | 产品有库存记录 |
| purchase_item_refs_product | 引用产品 | `relation_types/purchase_item_refs_product.bkn` | 采购明细引用产品 |
| purchase_order_belongs_supplier | 属于供应商 | `relation_types/purchase_order_belongs_supplier.bkn` | 采购订单属于某供应商 |
| purchase_order_has_item | 包含采购明细 | `relation_types/purchase_order_has_item.bkn` | 采购订单包含多行明细 |
| quotation_generates_order | 生成销售订单 | `relation_types/quotation_generates_order.bkn` | 报价单生成销售订单 |
| quotation_has_item | 包含报价明细 | `relation_types/quotation_has_item.bkn` | 报价单包含多行明细 |
| quotation_item_refs_product | 引用产品 | `relation_types/quotation_item_refs_product.bkn` | 报价明细引用产品 |
| quotation_signs_to_contract | 签订为合同 | `relation_types/quotation_signs_to_contract.bkn` | 报价单签订为合同 |
| user_creates_activity | 跟进活动 | `relation_types/user_creates_activity.bkn` | 销售员工创建跟进活动 |
| user_owns_contract | 负责合同 | `relation_types/user_owns_contract.bkn` | 销售员工负责合同 |
| user_owns_customer | 负责客户 | `relation_types/user_owns_customer.bkn` | 销售员工负责客户 |
| user_owns_lead | 负责线索 | `relation_types/user_owns_lead.bkn` | 销售员工负责线索 |
| user_owns_opportunity | 负责商机 | `relation_types/user_owns_opportunity.bkn` | 销售员工负责商机 |

### Action Types

| ID | Name | File Path | Description |
|----|------|-----------|-------------|
| contract_to_order | 合同生成订单 | `action_types/contract_to_order.bkn` | 合同签订生效后生成销售订单 |
| convert_lead | 线索转化 | `action_types/convert_lead.bkn` | 将已转化的线索同步为商机和客户记录 |
| order_to_invoice | 订单开票 | `action_types/order_to_invoice.bkn` | 销售订单发货完成后开具发票 |
| query_inventory | 查询库存 | `action_types/query_inventory.bkn` | 查询产品库存可用量（只读，平台暂不支持 query，用 modify 语义标注） |
| quotation_to_contract | 报价转合同 | `action_types/quotation_to_contract.bkn` | 报价单审批通过后生成合同 |
| receipt_verify | 收款核销 | `action_types/receipt_verify.bkn` | 登记收款并核销对应发票 |
| register_activity | 登记跟进 | `action_types/register_activity.bkn` | 登记客户跟进活动记录 |
| register_delivery | 登记发货 | `action_types/register_delivery.bkn` | 登记出库发货单 |

### Risk Types

| ID | Name | File Path | Description |
|----|------|-----------|-------------|

### Concept Groups

| ID | Name | File Path | Description |
|----|------|-----------|-------------|
| business_rules | 业务规则 | `concept_groups/business_rules.bkn` | 网络配套业务规则 Skill 的锚定分组。 |
| crm_core | 客户关系核心 | `concept_groups/crm_core.bkn` | 客户、联系人、线索、商机、跟进活动与组织维度 |
| fulfillment | 履约交付 | `concept_groups/fulfillment.bkn` | 发货、开票与回款 |
| procurement_stock | 采购库存 | `concept_groups/procurement_stock.bkn` | 供应商、采购订单与库存 |
| product_master | 产品主数据 | `concept_groups/product_master.bkn` | 产品及其价格、成本记录 |
| sales_documents | 销售单据 | `concept_groups/sales_documents.bkn` | 报价、合同、销售订单及其明细 |

